tras/1473c72e120ed25c2176cd543b9b98a5.mp4?t=1785983386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/extras/61777f891eb7b601204c8695f7f699ab.avif?t=1785983386\" width=1560 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing modern gameplay with its inspirations, <strong><i>SUPERMANEUVER</i></strong> handles as fast, snappy, and intuitive as ace pilots have come to expect arcade flight games to be, with all the selections of retro-futuristic planes and weapons inspired from the real world, or in altogether original designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dogfight with skillful AI, throw yourself into massive battlefields from below the crust to low earth orbit, and fight an enemy hellbent on saving the world—or getting rich on its ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this depicted in visuals replicated and iterated on from late 90s videogames in look, in sound, and in art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/extras/b1e9d9e9c1ca8aeb8ad80082d7f77f18.poster.avif?t=1785983386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/extras/b1e9d9e9c1ca8aeb8ad80082d7f77f18.webm?t=1785983386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/extras/b1e9d9e9c1ca8aeb8ad80082d7f77f18.mp4?t=1785983386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/extras/9e98ad0036dd0096e9ba1981af8ae23b.avif?t=1785983386\" width=1560 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 playable aircraft and 30 special weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A singleplayer campaign with two differing paths and unique missions, written and produced by Matthew &quot;FlyAwayNow&quot; Nguyen (Project Wingman).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of 20XX, where retro-futuristic cities and mega infrastructure become battlefields to fly over and destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full soundtrack featuring DnB, electronic, trance, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission Recorder/Replay system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complementary WSO (who is also your childhood friend!).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/extras/4e177c32393740f56864f47e1323c4e0.poster.avif?t=1785983386\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/extras/4e177c32393740f56864f47e1323c4e0.webm?t=1785983386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/extras/4e177c32393740f56864f47e1323c4e0.mp4?t=1785983386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Retro flightcade action; dogfight in the past's future with next generation aircraft over a war-torn country as a privateer combat pilot. Choose a path, fight a war, and immerse yourself in the world of 20XX.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/76c39ebb507a9b203e63ce33fee6bb911836bc54/header.jpg?t=1785983386", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573470/6f5fce31953cc46d64f52bfd5658e3f6a2ecfcd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=178